<title>USA: Philadelphia oversight board cancels April meeting.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia oversight board cancels April meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pennsylvania Intergovernmental Cooperation Authority, Philadelphia's oversight board, said Thursday it cancelled its April 15 board meeting.</p>
<p>The next regularly scheduled meeting is set for May 20 at 1000 EDT.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
